msgid "One item of the agent work plan, held by the beans CLI in the committed beans/ store, with a status, a parent and the beans it blocks."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/cat-harness.glossary.json:86
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/test-run
msgid "One measurement of a Skill: which skill it tests, the cases it exercised, and a hash of the data and a hash of the process that produced the result, so a third party can redo it. Its cases are checked against the skill's input and output contracts."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/cat-harness.glossary.json:28
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/permission
msgid "One ODRL rule allowing an assignee an action, optionally on a target and within constraints. A permission to a broader action permits every action included in it."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/cat-harness.glossary.json:41
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/task-run
msgid "One performance of a BPMN task by an Actor in a Role under a policy, recorded as a W3C PROV-O activity whose plan is the task."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/cat-harness.glossary.json:114
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/todo
msgid "One person's outstanding work, as a content node the folio owns, tagged with the roles, processes and tasks it concerns. Not the agent work plan, which is beans."
msgstr ""

